<title>USA: Newell Co completes Rolodex acquisition.</title>
<headline>Newell Co completes Rolodex acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>FREEPORT, Ill. 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Newell Co said Wednesday it completed its previously announced acquisition of the Rolodex business of Insilco Corp.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not announced.</p>
<p>Rolodex, with estimated 1996 annual revenues of $68 million, markets office products, Newell said.</p>
<p>Newell makes and markets consumer products through several retail and wholesale distribution channels.</p>
<p>Its shares were down 1/2 Wednesday at 36.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
